  "content": "[Intro]\n[Bb]\n[Dm]  [Gm]\n[Eb]  [Cm]  [Eb9]  [Gb7]\n[F7]I was born\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Bb]by the river\nin a little tent\n[Cm]And just like the river I've been running\n[Gm]ever since It's been a\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bb]long\n[Cm]time coming But I know [Eb7][D7]\n[Gm]a change is gonna come Oh,\n[Bb]yes it will It's been\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Bb]too hard living, but I'm af-\nraid to die\n[Cm]Cause I don't know what's up there\n[Gm]beyond the sky It's been a\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bb]long\n[Cm]time coming But I know [Eb7][D7]\n[Gm]a change is gonna come Oh,\n[Bb]yes it will I\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Bb]go to the movie, and I\ngo downtown\n[Cm]Somebody keep telling me \"don't\n[Gm]hang around\" It's been a\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bb]long\n[Cm]time coming But I know [Eb7][D7]\n[Gm]a change is gonna come Oh,\n[Bb]yes it will\n\n[Verse 4]\n[Cm]Then I go to my\n[Bb]brother,\n[Cm]and I say, \"brother, help me\n[Gm]please\"\n[Cm]But he winds up\n[Gm]knockin' me\n[C7]back down on my\n[F7]knees There been\n[Bb]times when I thought I couldn't\nlast for long\n[Cm]But now I think I'm able\n[Gm]to carry on It's been a\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bb]long\n[Cm]time coming But I know [Eb7][D7]\n[Gm]a change is gonna come Oh,\n[Bb]yes it will\n\n[Outro]\n[Bb]",
